2 CONC  that Duke Bengt's grandfather Brynjulf ​​Bengtsson was a son of the Vestgöta lawyer Bengt Hafridsson and an older brother of Mrs. Ramfrid Bengtsdotter. Concerning Bengt Hafridsson's and Bengt Algotsson's family connections in gen
