2 CONT * J Raneke, Sv Medieval Weapons, 1 (1982), p 119; SMoK; E o R Sparre, Medieval rafters (2003).
2 CONT * Gustaf Arvidsson (Arnvidsson): The accounts of Räven van Barne-kow for Nyköping's feudal 1365-67, ed B Fritz and E Odelman (1994)
2 CONT * Conradi Mattsson, aa; Medieval Sweden, 1: 3 and 1: 6 (1982-88); DS 4-9 (1853-2000); Engström, aa; B Fritz, A Folk-Young Stormer and His Various Roles (Studies in Older History, 1985), p 99; Gardell, aa.
2 CONT * H Gillingstam, aa: n; its, Ätterna Oxenstierna o Vasa during the Middle Ages (1952-53); its, 
2 CONT * Letter from the Askan (1996); Hildebrand, aa; KH Karlsson, The Swedish King's Judgment ... during the Middle Ages (1890), p 42; its, aa 1906, s 30 f; 
2 CONT * K Kumlien, Västerås wool beginning of the 17th century (1971); Lags o doms; J Liedgren, aa, s 23; Löfqvist, aa, pp. 247 and 259; PA Munch. 
2 CONT * The History of the Norwegian People, 2: 1-2 (1862-63); S Rahmqvist, aa; its, the Sandbro family (PHT 1978); RPB; Schlegel, aa, s 15 ff o III ff; L Sjöstedt, 
2 CONT * The crisis in the Swedish-Swedish Empire 1356-59 (1954); ST 2 (1883); Sweden's medieval personal names, 1, sp 155, o 2, sp 530 f; ESF 2: 1 (2001), p 66.
