1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Helena Magnusdotter (Sparre av Aspnäs)==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Magnus Gislason (Sparre av Aspnäs) and Birgitta Knutsdotter (Algotssönernas ätt) 
2 CONT * Helena Magnusdotter. Probably died at the earliest in 1373 but not later than 1380.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Married==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married by 1369 to the knight, the Council of Ministers and the Finnish lawman '''Arvid Gustafsson (Sparre av Vik),''' who died in 1379 or 1380. Their descendants inherited Magnus Gislason's former farm Örby.
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Sparre_av_Vik#TAB_3 '''Arvid Gustavsson (Sparre av Vik)'''] son of Gustav Arvidsson. Appears at the earliest in 1356. Mentioned as national council from 1362 and as a layman in Finland from 13
2 CONC 66. Became knight in 1372 or 1373. Appears as governor of Lagunda hd in Uppland 1377-1388. Died in 1379 or 1380. '''Married at the latest in 1369 to Helena Magnusdotter,''' who probably lived still in 1373 but was dead in 1380, da
2 CONC ughter of the knight and the national council Magnus Gislason ( Sparre of Aspnäs ) and Birgitta Knutsdotter (family of the Algots sons ).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Margaret Arvidsdotter,''' Owned Vik. Died 9.4 1415 and buried with her husband in Vadstena. Married no later than 1385 with the knight, the national council and the magistrate of Uppland Ture Bengtsson ( Bielke ), who died on
2 CONC  20 November 1414 and buried in Vadstena 14.1 1415. Their descendants inherited both Vik and Örby
2 CONT
2 CONT == Swedish Diplomatariums National Archives of of Medieval Letters
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK-nr: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=gustavsson&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=18&postid=sdhk_2650&tab=post#tab 13008]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Dating: 1385 December 31, of Issue: Nykoping
2 CONT
2 CONT Bo Jonsson, drots, Sten Bengtsson, knight and marshal, and Karl Ulfsson, knight and lawman in Uppland , report as executor of '''Mr. Arvid Gustavsson's (Sparre av Vik)''' wills, Mr. Anbjörn Larsson to probation at the prebend that
2 CONC  '''Arvid Gustavsson''' founded at Uppsala judgment church and to which he has allocated the following goods: land in Tibble in Husaby-Ernavi (now Husby-Långhundra) parish, in Väsby in Vallentuna parish etc. On the reverse: N vj (
2 CONC Uppsala cathedral box sign); 58 (Rasmus Ludvigsson letter sign for the cathedral) - https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897410732&photo_id=6000000140355823824&position=0
