2 CONT * Older Swedish salvation families I, p. 101
2 CONT * H. Gillingstam, Ätterna Oxenstierna and Vasa und medeltiden (1952), p. 47 f. and p. 739 with note 58
2 CONT * Halsten Petersson's family at roskildehistorie.dk
2 CONT * SDHK no: 10962
2 CONT * SDHK no: 11725
2 CONT * The Oxenstierna and Vasa families in the Middle Ages: family history studies . Stockholm: [Almqvist & Wiksell]. 1952–1953. Libris 8075012 
2 CONT *  Gillingstam (2001), p. 87.
2 CONT *  [ a b c d ] H. Gillingstam, Ätterna Oxenstierna och Vasa und medeltiden (1952), p. 47 f. and p. 739 with note 58
2 CONT * Weapon similarity trap: Weapons and seal use during the Swedish Middle Ages. An introduction for family historians, along with corrections to Swedish medieval weapons Archived March 21, 2019, retrieved from the Wayback Machine .
2 CONC  by Kaj Janzon , Swedish Genealogical Journal 2015:1
2 CONT *  Genealogica 41, fol. 258
2 CONT * Older Swedish salvation families I, p. 101
2 CONT * The Vinstorpa family at adelsvapen.com
2 CONT *  SDHK no: 11725
2 CONT * The National Archives. "SDHK 25585" . sok.riksarkivet.se . Read October 23, 2015 .
