1 OCCU Riddare 1443,  Riksråd 1443-03-10, Häradshövding i Åkerbo härad (1453-1480)
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ulf Pedersson (Roos Af Ervalla) is the 3rd great grandson of  [https://www.geni.com/path/H%C3%A5kon-V-Magnusson-King-of-Norway+is+related+to+Ulf-Pedersson-Roos-af-Ervalla?from=6000000000351087662&path_type=blood&to
2 CONC =6000000004281174911 Håkon V Magnusson King of Norway]
2 CONT
2 CONT http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00489376&tree=LEO
