2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000024185502572&photo_id=6000000190555878827&position=0 '''(1) Mattias Nilsson Kagg'''] (son of Nils Mattsson Kagge, Tab. 4), to Fjällskäfte in Floda paris
2 CONC h, Södermanland county as well as Kjellstorp in Örslösa parish and Brönas in Härene parish (both in Skaraborg county.). Are you included in the length of service for Uppland? 1526-08-10. Witnessed Västerås Riksdag 1527 (Mr.). Rece
2 CONC ived the district court in Skåning's district in Västergötland (GI r.) 1529-10-03, which Torsten Brunsson voluntarily granted to him. In the castle law on Leckö (GI r.) 1534-02-24 and again (GI r.) 1543-07-25, and (GI r.) 1558-09-
2 CONC 12. Signed the inheritance association 1544-01-13, King Gustaf I's will 1560-06-30 and the estates' grant in 1561. Sat ting 1564. On 1565-04-00 was told of his salvation, because he did not show up for the muster (GI r .). Still a
2 CONC live in 1568. (Mr.) Married 1st to Elin Lindormsdotter,daughter of Riksdag Lindorm Brunsson (Forstenasläkten, no. 2) and Karin Siggesdotter (Sparre). 2nd with Elin Gustafsdotter in her 1st marriage, who was still alive in 1603 (Vf
2 CONC f h. 2-3, p. 124.), daughter of the district chief in Barne district Gustaf Olofsson to Degeberg (Forstenaätten's coat of arms) and Anna Mattsdotter (Katle , No. 70).
2 CONT * Gift 2 med okänd..?
2 CONT
2 CONT
