1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Hope was born in 1573, at birth place, to Henry Hope and Jacqueline 'Joanna Juvitot' Hope (born De Tott). Henry was born in 1552, in Midlothian, Scotland. Jacqueline was born in 1556, in France. Thomas had 5
2 CONC  siblings: Ann Steuart (born Hope), Henry Hope and 3 other siblings. Thomas married Elizabeth Ann Hope (born Bennett) in 1602, at age 29 at marriage place. Elizabeth was born in 1585, in Wallyford, East Lothian, Scotland. They had
2 CONC  7 children: Mary Erskine (born Hope), James John Hope and 5 other children. His occupation was occupation. Thomas passed away on month day 1646, at age 73 at death place.
2 CONT
