2 CONT =Princess Cecilia of Sweden=
2 CONT Cecilia of Sweden, (Swedish: '''Cecilia Gustavsdotter Vasa''') (Stockholm, 16 November 1540 – Brussels, 27 January 1627), was Princess of Sweden as the daughter of King Gustav I and his second queen, Margareta Leijonhufvud, a Swed
2 CONC ish noble and Margravine of Baden-Rodemachern through marriage with Christopher II, Margrave of Baden-Rodemachern. She was regent of Baden-Rodemachern in the 1580s.
2 CONT
