2 CONT * Daughter of Joen Andersson, knighted Gyldenroos and Margareta Joensdotter Torskenstierna 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Gyldenroos_nr_472 Noble House Gyldenroos No. 472, by Adelsvapen Geneaologies] 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Joen Andersson, knighted Gyldenroos , to Fröslunda in Harakers sn; captain; fired; knighted 11/11/1649. He is probably identical to the Joen Andersson, who in 1636 became a cornet in the Uppland cavalry and (after 1641) was "abdic
2 CONC ated" in Germany. Married to Margareta Torskenstierna , daughter of the horseman at Uppland's cavalry (life reg on horse) Joen Andersson ( Toskenstierna ), to Ölstad and Hallstad, who must have received shield letter in the 16th c
2 CONC entury, and Ingrid Månsdotter ( Roos af Hjelmsäter ).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Margareta Gyldenroos,''' † 1663. Married in 1640 to the assessor Claes Planting-Gyllenbåga , † 1648.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://www.almanachdegotha.org/id224.html
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Gustaf Elgenstierna , The introduced genealogical tables of the Swedish nobility. 1925-36.
2 CONT * Svenska Adelns Ättar-Taflor: Granfelt fran Dal - Mörner af Tuna, Volume 2, edited by Gabriel Anrep
