1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Märta Johansdotter Ulf=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *  '''Married  (1st) to Johan Bengtsson, Lily of Värnäs'''
2 CONT * Married (2nd) to  '''Niklas Rask.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Ulf_af_Horsn%C3%A4s_nr_56 Noble family Ulf af Horsnäs no. 56, by Adelsvapen Genealogies]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT TABLE 3- '''Johan Gudmundsson (son of Gudmund Pedersson,''' table 1), to Hällerstad in Östra Ryds parish, Brånnestad in Gistads parish and Torlunda and Klinga in Löts parish, all in Östergötland county, which farms he and his brot
2 CONC hers received from King Erik on 12/01/1561 for the consideration in Fittja village in Lagunda district Uppsala county, which the council awarded to their mother for Örby 7 . Sealed among the nobility, King Gustaf I's will in 1560 
2 CONC and the estates' grant in 1561 (when he signed himself to Skravestad). Was present at the mustering with the savior in Östergötland in 1563 5 . Ship's chief officer. Died 1570-06-15 on the ship Engeln and buried s. å. 13/7 in Öste
2 CONC rhaninge church Stockholms län, where his shield with the Ulf weapon and signature was set up. '''Married 1560-10-21 to his sister-in-law's sister Kerstin Marboin her 1st marriage (married 2nd 1575-06-12 at Hällerstad 9 to the pre
2 CONC fect Tyge Larsson, knighted Gyllencreutz , in his 1st marriage, died 1625), died 1603 8 , daughter of the castle law at Stegeborg, chamber councilor Truls Andersson Skrivare (Marbo) to Ravanäs, who in the coat of arms brought half
2 CONC  a lily and a star, and his 3rd wife Karin Eriksdotter Slätte (no. 97).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Märta Johansdotter . Married 1st to Johan Bengtsson to Värnäs in Värna parish, Östergötland county. Married 2nd to 10 Niklas Rask.'''
2 CONT * '''Beata Johansdotter ,''' died 1580-09-24 in Hällerstad in the plague and buried in Östra Ryd's church
2 CONT * '''Christer Johansson ,''' died 1600. See Tab. 4.
2 CONT * '''Ingeborg Johansdotter ,''' died 160(2?) 20/11. Married to the vice president Jöns Nilsson Jacobsköld , no. 85, in his 1st marriage, born about 1569, died 1633.
2 CONT * '''Malin Johansdotter ,''' was alive at the distribution of the inheritance after the father in 1582. [ 8 ]
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://runeberg.org/elgenst/8/0499.html
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
