2 CONC ed (OA). 12 Al. I, p. 63. 13 Of. 14 Västra härad's dombok, 15 Marbäck's church archive. 16 GH (HF). 17 Ry, part 3, p. 181. 18 Ry, part 4, p. 233. 19Ry, part 4, p. 241. 20 Lk. 21 Bankekind's county registry office born 12 Nov. 1685
2 CONC  (OA). 22 GH (HF). 23 Rf. 24 Vff II: 4–5, p. 44, note 1. 25 Notice by Consul Harald Ehrenborg.
2 CONT * Gustaf Elgenstierna , The introduced genealogical tables of the Swedish nobility. 1925-36.
