1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Koppskatten of 1645 (Einar is listed at Bjelland with his wife and a female servant):'''
2 CONT Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Reviderte regnskaper, Lensregnskaper, AV/RA-EA-5023/R/Rb/Rbs/L0029: Stavanger len, 1641-1647. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/rk20080826640513
