2 CONT
2 CONT '''Probate record (16-08-1679; Einar had died, and the heirs were listed as the widow, Siri Halvorsdatter, and their daughter Gitlaug Einarsdatter; as well Einar's daughter from an earlier marriage, Tora Einarsdatter Bjelland):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, AV/SAST-A-100306/5/50BA/L0002: SKIFTEPROTOKOLL. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20081106650467
