2 CONT '''Probate record (16-08-1679; Einar had died, and the heirs were listed as the widow, Siri Halvorsdatter, their daughter; as well Siri's step-daughter):'''
2 CONT Jæren og Dalane sorenskriveri, AV/SAST-A-100306/5, 1672-1693, s. 58. https://www.digitalarkivet.no/sk20110328650198
2 CONT ----
