2 CONT DEATH: 0 ___ 1669, Hjelmarvik Skånevik 
2 CONT
2 CONT REFERENCE: Z 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Jone OLSEN 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Margrete INGEBRIKTSDATTER 
2 CONT
