1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mikkel Arnbjørnson, son of Arnbjørn Gjermundson and Mortensdotter, was born in Gjedrem, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and died in Gjedrem, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mikkel married someone. 
2 CONT
2 CONT His children were: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i.  Mikkelsdotter was born circa 1595 in Gjedrem, Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR and died in Evje indre, Sokndal, Rogaland, NOR. Mikkelsdotter married Børild Ovaldson, son of Ovald and Kari Børildsdotter, circa 1615 in Bjerkreim kyrkje,
2 CONC  Bjerkreim, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ii.  Knud Mikkelson. Knud married Larsdotter, daughter of Lars Andersson? and Unknown, circa 1630 in Jelsa kyrkje, Jelsa, Rogaland, NOR. 
