2 CONT [S2] Danmarks Adels Aarbog, Thiset, Hiort-Lorenzen, Bobé, Teisen., (Dansk Adelsforening), [1884 - 2005]., DAA 1932:II:178.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Henrik Eriksen Urup
2 CONT
2 CONT Born: Abt 1525, Ulen, Tønsberg, Vestfold, Norge 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Karen Iversdatter Baden (Jernskæg) in 1560 
2 CONT
2 CONT Died: 25 Jun 1567, Akershus festning, Oslo, Norge about age 42 
2 CONT
2 CONT Henrik married Karen Iversdatter Baden (Jernskæg), daughter of Iver Jensen Baden til Fritsø and Karen Olufsdatter Galde, in 1560. (Karen Iversdatter Baden (Jernskæg) was born on 21 Apr 1538 in Fritsø, Herdum, Vestfold, Norge and d
2 CONC ied on 18 Nov 1587 in Skjernæs.)
