1 NAME Sten Svantesson /Bielke/
2 GIVN Sten Svantesson
2 SURN Bielke
2 _MARNM Bielke
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1598
2 PLAC Kråkerum
2 ADDR
3 CITY Mönsterås
