2 CONC ii. 333; 1558-1603, ii. 208; Bantock, 52. 16. Cal. Corresp. of Smyth Fam. p. xvii; Bristol RO, Smyth of Long Ashton ms AC/C48/4; Bantock, 68. 17. Bantock, 68, 72-3; Bristol RO, AC/C43/1. 18. Bristol RO, AC/C44/4; Bantock, 72. 19. 
