2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Torstensson (son of Torsten Brunsson, table 12), to Lunden in Vassända parish, in Väne county and (A. Lignell. Description over Dal.) Olsängen in Färgelanda parish, and Steg in Rännelanda parish, (both in Älvsborg county). Me
2 CONC ntioned as a witness (Hildebrand, Sv. historia.) 16-06-1558. Sealed the nobility's declaration of approval of Gustaf I's will etc. (Mr.) 1560-07-30 and the renewed declaration of allegiance to King Erik 1561 (Mr.). Mentioned among
2 CONC  the saved in 1563 (Hra.), but was dead in 1577 (A. Lignell. Description over Dal.). Married to Carin Söfrinsdotter, daughter of Söfrin (Severin) Kijl and Malin Ribbing. (No. 15).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Henning Hansson, died unmarried before 1579.
2 CONT Gustaf Hansson.
2 CONT Kerstin. His daughter. Married to Christoffer Göransson at Kolbäck (Lilliehöök?).
2 CONT '''Margareta Hansdotter. Married to Torkel Grijs (no. 192).'''
2 CONT Anna Hansdotter.
2 CONT Brita Hansdotter.
2 CONT Carin Hansdotter, died (M.) 1651-07-07. Probably married to (M.) a member of the Rylanda and Häggetorps family or Lindelöf to Kedom, no. 129.
2 CONT Ingeborg Hansdotter.
