2 CONT * Partner: (No proof of marriage) [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=321297154720002306&photo_id=6000000172317147066&position=0 '''(1) Jakob Jacobsson Snakenborg,'''] Married (2) married Kerstin Tott , d 1
2 CONC 624 25/5 (Older Swedish Salvation Family 3, 1989, p 289).
2 CONT * Married '''(2) Jakob Jonsson, i Lång, Grums,''' in 1580, when Elin her daughter was around 2 years old.  In a letter from Duke Carl, dated March 21, 1580, "our beloved Jakob Jonsson" is allowed to use the estates that he and his
2 CONC  wife acquired from her father Pär Larsson "which are lying in Värmland", but with the condition that not on any way to dispose of them without first "offering and granting ourselves to all others". This freedom from taxation has 
2 CONC somehow been suspended temporarily and in a letter from Jakob Jonsson to Duke Carl, dated Gripsholm on April 23, 1595, he writes: "I, Jakob Jonsson to Lång, confess that after my K. Wife Hamfrid Pedersdotter, they have squandered 
2 CONC her estate were inherited, under Cronan, for the reason that she took me as a married man as an unsalvated man, and Sweden's law contains that a freed woman farmer, then gives tax and debt as a farmer..." after further attestation
2 CONC s, "... with the good consent of my wife and relatives is given and given... His Princely Grace... my wife's inheritance Söderby named in Sone parish on Kållen in Västergötland lies... to eternal property. . and for further confir
2 CONC mation I request the seals of the honest and virtuous men Nils Månsson and Olaf Cristoffersson as well as my own below this letter..." By this counterstroke it seems that he cleared up the situation. Frälsegården Mellbyn in Bro (S
2 CONC ) was owned in turn by Peder Larsson till Bro, Jakob Jonsson and Elin Jakobsdotter. Kjell Magnell - SoH 1965 no. 2-3 p.415-416. Frälsegården Mellbyn in Bro (S) was owned in turn by Peder Larsson till Bro, Jakob Jonsson and Elin Ja
2 CONC kobsdotter. Kjell Magnell - SoH 1965 no. 2-3 p.415-416. Frälsegården Mellbyn in Bro (S) was owned in turn by Peder Larsson till Bro, Jakob Jonsson and Elin Jakobsdotter. Kjell Magnell - SoH 1965 no. 2-3 p.415-416.  Died around 160
2 CONC 5 in Lång, Grums (S) [1] .  '''Source:''' Kjell Magnell Family and Family 1965 p.397-420.
2 CONT
