1 NAME Mats /Kagg/
2 GIVN Mats
2 _MARNM Kagg
2 NICK Matts
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 29 JUL 1590
2 ADDR
3 CITY Örslösa (R)
3 CTRY Sweden
