2 CONC ewenhaupt; B Liljekrantz, Benjamin H (1912); C L[indberg], Carl Theodor H (Kansallinen elämäkerrasto, 2, 1929); J B Lohman, Arboga känning (1737), s 147, 149 ff, 205 ff; V Marstrand, ^tten Tersmedens oprindelse (PHT 1926); J Molle
2 CONC rus, Cimbria litterata, 1 (1744); M Neiiendam, Anna Owena Hoyers (DBL 10, 1936); B Norling, Nya skolan (1880), s 103—09, 117 f; J Reu-ter, Finlandssv tekniker, 1 (1923); A B Roe, Anna Owena Hoyers, a poetess of the seven-teenth ce
