1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Margareta Lennartsdotter Svenske (nr.258)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Lennart Pedersson Svenske and Elin Jakobsdotter Bååt 
2 CONT * Born 1602 in Eskilsäter/S. 
2 CONT * Died 1673 in Steneby/P. To your gel bay and pile, Steneby.
2 CONT * To your gel bay and pile, Steneby.
2 CONT * Margareta was widowed 1636, when her husband died in the Verbs, Saxony, during the 30-year war. She then inherited the farm your gel cove in Steneby. However, the real owner was her mother, Elin Jacobsdotter Bååt, until about 16
2 CONC 46.  Mrs. Margareta took 1655 to save the homestead pile to the farmhouse, and the 1656 was recorded both North and south of your gel cove as the pile as her seat yards. She also owned the Sword village, and from 1664 also Hälgeru
2 CONC d. During her lifetime, she gave the children away with their own seating yards. She had 8 children. (Sources: The book "Steneby", the book "Ärtemark-a Dalsland parish" of I Löfgren) 
2 CONT * [https://archive.org/details/arkivkopia.se-runeberg-ladal/page/n63/mode/2up?q=Svinhufvud '''Page N69 (10) Old manor. See X: o 7. was owned in 1664 by Mrs. Margareta Svenske: 1686 by Fänriken Ears Svinhufvud: 1600 by Luiradshöfdi
2 CONC ngen Joh. RHO-DIN. who bought this manor from the latter for 500 riksdaler Kurant. 1 later times belonged to the egers of Billingsholm's iron mill. Source: Beskrifning öfver grefskapet Dal.''']
2 CONT * [https://archive.org/details/arkivkopia.se-runeberg-ladal/page/n69/mode/2up?q=Svenske '''Page N69 (7) Dyngowiik was written 1449. was then owned by the armor Sven Jonsson, and thus ancient farm. See one of him published Morning-
2 CONC Giftvobref at Grinstad parish, N: o 8. The same Sven Jonsson is mentioned in a letter on 10 ebr. 1494 (printed by Eilljegren after the original in v. Engeström Library, 1819. page 41). Published by Magnus Bonde's widow Kadrin Ingw
2 CONC arsdotter. Was owned by the well-to-do Mrs. Karin, who held both Dingelviks farms. Eästviken, Åsen, Högen, Hölgerud, Sea, Bågen and others. In 1577 Nils Månsson at Bro was here: 1664 Mrs. Margareta Swedish: 1783 Hofjunkare Reuter:
2 CONC  1809 Ryttmä-Staren Sam. Kafle: 1827 Carl Pet. Åberg: 1845 The Crown County Man in Näs hardened by Wermland J. E. Wennerlöf: 18-17 Baronen S: t Gyr and Countess Ramel, born eewenhaupt. source: Beskrifning öfver grefskapet Dal.]
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=4579543&photo_id=6000000201897228844&position=0 A '''Large Landowner in Värmland and Dalsland. Margareta Persdotter died childless in Bro around 1629 and Elin Jacobsdot
2 CONC ter Snakeborg Bat, wife of master rider Lennart Persson Svenske, registered as the nearest heir. Nils Mảnsson Roos Margareta Persdotter.''']
2 CONT
