2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=4579543&photo_id=6000000190352041878&position=0 '''Carl Jönsson (Svinhufvud)'''] Son of Jöns Danielsson Svinhufvud, till Framby and Christina Larsdotter von Kö
2 CONC llen. Pedigree chart born 1599 in Steneby/P., dead 1636 in Norra Åsum/L.  Major and District Judge.  Of the noble family Svinhufvud in Västergötland. To large DIN Gel bay in Steneby, Lieutenant at Närkes and Värmlands regemente 16
2 CONC 22, later major 1634. District judge in cut Cheeks hundred, Östergötland, 1635. 
2 CONT
