1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir Thomas</strong>, born 11 February 1633, and died before 26 March 1663; married Elizabeth, daughter of Sir John Aytoun of that Ilk, who married, secondly, on the last-mentioned date, John Gibson of Durie. His male issu
2 CONC e came to an end in the person of his last surviving grandson Sir John Bruce Hope of Kinross, who died 5 June 1766."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft#page/490/mode/2up The Scots peerage], Vol. IV, page 490
