1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == Biographical Summary ==
2 CONT "<strong>Sir Archibald of Rankeillour</strong>, baptized 9 September 1639; admitted Advocate 30 June 1664; an ordinary Lord of Session 1 November 1689, and a Lord Justiciary 27 January 1696, about which time he was knighted. Died 
2 CONC 10 October 1706. Married Margaret, daughter of Sir John Aytoun of that Ilk, and was ancestor of the Hopes of Pinkie, now the senior branch of the family."
2 CONT
2 CONT >SOURCE: [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft#page/490/mode/2up The Scots peerage], Vol. IV, page 490
