1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == THOMAS HOPE OF KERSE ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Thomas Hope of Kerse, here treated, is not mentioned in the Scots Peerage account of the Hope family, [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/page/490/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 49
2 CONC 0] However, he was the son, evidently the eldest son, of https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Hope-of-Kerse/6000000014141399909?through=6000000226012644000, [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?refere
2 CONC nce=GD37%2f134&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=thomas+hope&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1630&dt=1650&di=n NRS: GD37/134] and his wife https://www.geni.com/people/Helen-Rae/6000000014141466942?through=6000000226012644000. [https://catalogue.nrscotla
2 CONC nd.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD37%2f138&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Helen+Rae&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1700&di=n NRS GD37/138]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT HOPE
2 CONT THOMAS
2 CONT THOMAS HOPE/ANNA RAE FR985 (FR985)
2 CONT M
2 CONT 30/03/1632
2 CONT 685 / 1
2 CONT 40 / 98
2 CONT Edinburgh
2 CONT == Death ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Thomas Hope of Kerse, here treated, was alive on 8 April 1646, [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD37%2f139&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=Helen+Rae&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1600&dt=1700&di=n NRS
2 CONC : GD37/139] but he died before 1 December 1646. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD37%2f140&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=thomas+hope&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1630&dt=1650&di=n  NRS: GD37/140]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == His Successor at Kerse ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Thomas Hope of Kerse, here treated, was succeeded at Kerse by his younger brother https://www.geni.com/people/Alexander-Hope-of-Kerse-Baronet/6000000014141525636?through=6000000226012644000, who was married to Miss Louisa Hunte
2 CONC r at Rotterdam in the Netherlands on on 12 December 1659. [https://archive.org/details/historyofscottis00stevuoft/page/296/mode/1up Rotterdam: 296] [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft
2 CONC /page/490/mode/1up The Scots Peerage IV: 490]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
