2 CONC &st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=thomas+hope&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=1630&dt=1650&di=n National Records of Scotland, Papers of the Bruce family of Airth, reference GD37/134]'''
