2 CONT '''Sir Alexander Hope of Kerse, born 6, baptized 12 December 1637, created Baronet 30 May 1672, died December 1673, and was buried in the Greyfriars, Edinburgh, 1 January 1674. He married,12 December 1639, at Delft in the Netherla
2 CONC nds, 'Mistress Louisa Hunter'. His male issue became extinct in the person of his great-grandson about 1674. [http://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun04pauluoft#page/490/mode/2up The Scots peerage, Vol. IV, page 490] [http://arc
2 CONC hive.org/stream/cu31924092524408#page/n309/mode/2up Complete baronetage; Cokayne, George E. (George Edward); 1900; Vol. IV; page 290]'''
