2 CONT
2 CONT Children  	
2 CONT
2 CONT +	1. William Erskine,   d. Bef 10 Oct 1739
2 CONT
2 CONT +	2. David Erskine, 4th Lord Cardross, 9th Earl of Buchan,   c. 3 Jan 1672, Port of Menteith, Perthshire, Scotland ,   d. 14 Oct 1745, London, England 
2 CONT
2 CONT +	3. Catherine Anne Erskine,   b. Abt 1684, Cardross, Angusshire, Scotland ,   d. 18 Jul 1752  
2 CONT
