1 NAME Erik /Wernstedt/ till Brotorpet
2 GIVN Erik
2 NSFX till Brotorpet
2 _MARNM Wernstedt
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1635
1 DEAT
2 DATE AFT 1673
2 PLAC Brotorpet
