1 CONC egering 1441-1448 var han ledamot avdet regeringsutskott, som skulle fungera under kungens frånvaro ur riket.
0 @N6000000006127494363@ NOTE known 1416, squire, councillor of the realm, died after 21 October 1450, buried Uppsala cathedral, married 1stly Kristina Ivarsdotter; married 2ndly Kristina Pedersdotter (Stallare?); married 3rdly after 20 May 1429 Katarina Karls
