0 @N6000000002322320612@ NOTE He was a popular monarch who did much to heal the wounds and solve the
1 CONT problems created by his father, Sigismund III Vasa, as obstinate man and
1 CONT religious bigot who created internal friction in Poland and pursued a series
1 CONT of wars abroad. Wladyslaw sought to make Poland secure during a period of
1 CONT change in northern Europe and Russia. He failed, however, in his attempt to
1 CONT regain the Swedish crown, which had been held and lost by his father.
